="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/property-holdings-incorporated/">phi</a></div><div class="closing">14</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/republic-bank-guyana-limited/">rbl</a></div><div class="closing">539.9</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>0.1 (0.02%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/rupununi-development-company-limited/">rdl</a></div><div class="closing">500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/sterling-products-limited/">spl</a></div><div class="closing">841.5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="feature background group" style="background:url(https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/financing-2380158_1920-1600x1067.jpg) no-repeat center 50%; background-size:cover;"><div class="overlay"><div class="wrapper"><div class="content"><h1><div class="title">Banks DIH Holdings Inc.</div></h1></div></div></div></div> <main id="main" class="site-main wrapper group" role="main"><div class="sidebar col span-3"><div class="feed"><div class="bulletins"><h3>Bulletins</h3><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#27212" class="inline-popup">Banks DIH Holdings Inc. (BDH) &#8211; pays $0.70 per share Second Interim Dividend 2026</a></div><div id="27212" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Banks DIH Holdings Inc. met on September 25, 2026 and approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $0.70 per share to be paid on October 26, 2026. The share register will be closed on October 12, 2026 to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 224"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/224/">Bulletin 224</a></span><span class="date">September 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26563" class="inline-popup">Banks DIH Holdings Inc. (BDH) &#8211; pays $0.70 per share First Interim Dividend 2026</a></div><div id="26563" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Banks DIH Ltd. met on April 30, 2026 and approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $0.70 per share to be paid on May 28, 2026. The share register will be closed on May 20, 2026 to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 220"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/220/">Bulletin 220</a></span><span class="date">May 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25766" class="inline-popup">Banks DIH Holdings Inc. (BDH) &#8211; Final Dividend of $1.70 for 2025</a></div><div id="25766" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Banks DIH Holdings Inc. met on November 27, 2025 and approved the payment of a Final Dividend of $1.70 per share for the year ended September 30, 2025, subject to approval at the Annual General Meeting to be held on January 31, 2026. The share register will be closed for the period December 11, 2025 to January 31, 2026, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Final Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 216"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/216/">Bulletin 216</a></span><span class="date">November 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25574" class="inline-popup">Banks DIH Holdings Inc. (BDH) &#8211; pays $0.65 per share Second Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="25574" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Banks DIH Ltd. met on October 20, 2025 and approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $0.65 per share to be paid on October 29, 2025. The share register will be closed on October 29, 2025 to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 215"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/215/">Bulletin 215</a></span><span class="date">October 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24843" class="inline-popup">Banks DIH Holdings Inc. (DBH) &#8211; pays $0.65 per share First Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="24843" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Banks DIH Ltd. met on April 24, 2025 and approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $0.65 per share to be paid on May 21, 2025. The share register will be closed on May 15, 2025 to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 212"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/212/">Bulletin 212</a></span><span class="date">April 2025</span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="primary" class="content-area col span-9"><h2> Financials</h2><div class="carousel financials financial-nav"><div class="slide" id="2026">2026</div><div class="slide" id="2025">2025</div></div><div class="small">-->Select Year</div><div class="slider financials financial-years"><div class="year slide" id="2026"><h3>2026</h3><div class="fin-data"><table class="financial-session"><thead><tr><th class="session">Session</th><th class="date">Session Date</th><th class="mnemonic">Last Trade Price(G$)</th><th class="name">EPS (G$)</th><th class="best bid">P/E Ratio</th><th class="vol bid">Dividends paid in last 12 monts (G$)</th><th class="best offer">Dividend Yield</th><th class="vol offer">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="trade" BDH><td class="session"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/financial_session/1154/">1154</a></td><td class="date">05/01/2026</td><td class="name">155.0</td><td class="best bid">12.51</td><td class="vol bid">12.4</td><